<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine to issue Cheung Kong warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine to issue Cheung Kong warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said in a statement on Monday it intended to issue 70 million call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$60.75	PREMIUM	 12.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.783	GEARING	 7.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.OCT.97</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT DATE   ABOUT TWO WEEKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	  HK$60.75</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
